    "directions": [
      "In a pan add banana, beetroot, water, salt, ginger, vinegar, sugar, black pepper cons then cover and cook until the beetroot is completely cooked.",
      "Once cooked, take a hand blender and blend it into a fine paste.",
      "Now add more water, degi red chilli powder then boil it for 10-15 minutes.",
      "Remove the lid, stir it once then strain it properly through a strainer.",
      "Then add back the strained mixture to the pan then add some water and give it a final boil.",
      "Remove and let it cool down properly then store it in an airtight container."
    ],
